# Failover — environment configuration
#
# NEVER put a private key, mnemonic, or funded signer in this file or any
# .env file committed to the repo. All writes go through the user's own
# injected wallet (window.ethereum); there is no backend signer.

# Set only after a real deployment to Studionet (chain 61999). Left empty
# means the frontend runs in demo/fixture mode (see lib/fixtures/).
NEXT_PUBLIC_FAILOVER_REGISTRY_ADDRESS=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FAILOVER_GATE_ADDRESS=
